nce, and catharsis.","evidence_claim":"Lewis & Clark identifies the (Anti)Valentine’s Concert as an annual college tradition created by Professor Katherine FitzGibbon and reported that its 2025 production was the 17th edition.","source_url":"https://www.lclark.edu/live/news/newsroom-story-this-antivalentines-concert-is-sure-to-mend-a","source_title":"This (Anti)Valentine’s Concert Is Sure to Mend Any Broken Heart","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-02-11","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Venue, date, performers, and ticket requirements can change; consult the current Music Department listing before attending.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lewis-clark-festival-scholars-artists","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Festival of Scholars and Artists","title":"Replace an Entire Class Day With Student Work","subtitle":"FOSA fills campus with research, performance, exhibitions, and posters","notes":"Clear the day for short presentations, poster sessions, live performances, and exhibitions; use the published schedule to move between disciplines.","short_summary":"Regular classes yield to a full-campus presentation day where students share academic research and creative work.","evidence_claim":"Lewis & Clark calls the Festival of Scholars and Artists a beloved annual tradition and states that the community dedicates a full day to student research, creative accomplishments, and other achievements.","source_url":"https://college.lclark.edu/festival-of-scholars/","source_title":"Festival of Scholars and Artists","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The festival follows a new program each year; use the official FOSA schedule to confirm sessions and locations.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_i